<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (processes of an educational institution. LUMEN is a centralized, relational database-driven application that addresses the growing need for structured and efficient management of student-related data in universities and colleges.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
348 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Managing student information manually or through fragmented systems often leads to inefficiencies, data loss, and miscommunication. To address these challenges, LUMEN aims to provide a centralized platform that digitizes and automates the core functions of academic institutions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
